{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":141319,"name":null,"username":"HMorita","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/h/47e85d/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-07-27T02:24:54.131Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eDear House of Stake / NEAR DAO Support \u0026amp; Recovery Team,\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI am writing to formally report a cryptocurrency theft and request an urgent investigation and, if possible, the immediate freezing of the stolen assets that have flowed into NEAR Intents.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSummary\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTotal stolen: 142.81646368 BTC\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDate of theft: Between 7:09 AM on September 24, 2025 and 1:54 PM on September 25, 2025 (UTC)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCurrent known destination address: 14Cd2PTNgEzeLhc2pg8FETwnWo4Hj4jMF5\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLaw enforcement involvement: The Metropolitan Police Department has already contacted NEAR Intents regarding this case.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNEAR Intents’ response: We were instructed to submit our freeze request to NEAR DAO / House of Stake, who would coordinate the request internally.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVictim Information\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eContact Email: hmorita@sbigroup.co.jp\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCountry of Residence: Japan\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col start=\"2\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIncident Summary\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur wallet was compromised through unauthorized access, resulting in the theft of 142.81646368 BTC. The stolen funds were transferred through several Bitcoin addresses before ultimately being sent to NEAR Intents.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col start=\"3\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eKey Transaction Details\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTheft Transaction Hashes\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ecaf71f07fdf1218ac6f98372b72802db965429c9e320a79136874578ae7c16a6\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e3f381cc6410b6646ced7270183acd820d8069ee8aa5bdf7c16d87fdccd959eb9\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003efbef857392ee4bee987cfe8a40e0b7514d86b28558865cea5f9b97e8fe6a1aed\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ecab51b977411fce5c8b55d0a14a6be24c282e6f0a6327934d4b605879e6ebf3f\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e51f492583b0bfeca7cf9ce26eb997ac76094241471e1917220b142662d699af4\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e6c2f93f47e04437ee87f8e63fe1713c2469663ccec13d04292bd2ef184b55958\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e9bb1d81e5e820d963a7ab67d785c31a30c214271f088b908fc32847ad6cbbf79\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ed7e828269bde78ec75615830fdaa63b7122815b2e0f6a124037c829d82004577\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ee1af987db297112f481233782c6ddb35f197fc844d4ca938038aadac4b693e10\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e137c1f192ce1102ebe3ef81def9e88fe4808ff48ed10d5cf87488464d7be09c1\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ed34ab6ae47ec5e939783c3fbdbc8d598175eb5d00a1e62c24e2a0b1bcbf19d31\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStolen Funds Inflow to NEAR Intents\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDestination address\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e14Cd2PTNgEzeLhc2pg8FETwnWo4Hj4jMF5\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDirect transfer\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e28166bce92598475175432348baacad810d762a1225dc936f21c5d3197d4b91e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVia multiple intermediary addresses\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ecb5a5ae55aad608f71698068bd0186bc86714a17ac26993a4771c3879745a811\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ec3b751fe28216e2570f3db311a81ea34b5ab767ec38dfcd66825d4be21cd548e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003edcdf65be49157b94dea3945f3d90e5010e6d62ffff5b6da13b832b5b9c178a03\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ece847cc6b26a9d2712c4d1ccc4dbda618c7837b178fe866dd9ebb9c954ba1969\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBranch from address bc1qzx6l7pwnjenen38p48s9uuzc6wyj0rpu7x73dj – Route 1\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eebe52340dfdcb25ee64fa7071ac7cc3e6184da284a4e76309fde63b80f659eab\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e8f6ed04f9b0112a3c7f5a179ec62a9eed68003a71f375f0d7939fc18cd532aef\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1d70a786a7e33af385978f38d514bc299432586c2d8dc3b1894b72654a5e8b28\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1cbe544390037b3f9495aba641dee824eb94e7746a4a06bba208d2b94c4c12c8\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBranch from address bc1qzx6l7pwnjenen38p48s9uuzc6wyj0rpu7x73dj – Route 2\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eebe52340dfdcb25ee64fa7071ac7cc3e6184da284a4e76309fde63b80f659eab\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e4ccad5b6f365efe39afeef3e92fd58f3ab82d2b9cbfc63d7416785b45298e516\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBranch from address bc1qkjdjv4v7qatgqdjfs5kuphye38wn6wnh372380 – Route 1\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e9c6b429e9142ae615fee478be04b3416791fe434bd626603d07b68f7529d4d12\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBranch from address bc1qkjdjv4v7qatgqdjfs5kuphye38wn6wnh372380 – Route 2\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e9c6b429e9142ae615fee478be04b3416791fe434bd626603d07b68f7529d4d12\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e807e07f29d1e68a11323f7a105ddd4f3baf395e1fdc7080693b2875bd2e1897f\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col start=\"4\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePrevious Actions\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Metropolitan Police Department has already contacted NEAR Intents regarding this incident.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNEAR Intents responded as follows:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e“If you have a freeze or data request, please address it to the NEAR DAO and we will route it internally.”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAccordingly, I am submitting this formal request to the NEAR DAO / House of Stake.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col start=\"5\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRequest\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI respectfully request:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eImmediate freezing of the identified stolen funds, if still possible.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInvestigation into the movement of the stolen assets.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAssistance with recovery and coordination with the relevant parties.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGuidance on any additional steps we should take.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI have also reported this incident to local law enforcement.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDue to the submission form restrictions, I was unable to include blockchain explorer links in this report. I can immediately provide the relevant blockchain explorer links, TRM tracing results, screenshots, and any additional supporting documentation upon request.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAs these assets may still be recoverable, we would sincerely appreciate your urgent assistance and any action you are able to take.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThank you very much for your time and attention.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBest regards,\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHiroaki Morita\u003cbr\u003e\nCEO\u003cbr\u003e\nSBI Crypto Co., Ltd.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2026-07-27T02:33:08.477Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":46,"reads":23,"readers_count":22,"score":229.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":42360,"topic_slug":"stolen-funds-inquiry-freeze-request-btc-flowed-into-near-intents","display_username":null,"primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":13071,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/stolen-funds-inquiry-freeze-request-btc-flowed-into-near-intents/42360/1","calendar_details":[],"reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":141351,"name":"Yuen","username":"Yuen","avatar_template":"/user_avata